/* Duplicates across backups */
"Already backed up" = "已备份过";
"New" = "新文件";
"%@ files · %@" = "%1$@ 个文件 · %2$@";
"Compared with %@ by name and size. During the backup every file is checked with SHA-256; files already stored there are not stored again." = "已按文件名和大小与 %@ 比对。备份时每个文件都会用 SHA-256 确认，已在其中保存过的文件不会再存一份。";
"Duplicates skipped" = "重复已跳过";
"%@ files, %@, will be copied into:\n%@\n\nAbout %@ of them (%@) are already in other backups on this drive and will not be stored again.\n\nOriginal files will not be changed or deleted." = "将处理 %1$@ 个文件（%2$@），备份到：\n%3$@\n\n其中约 %4$@ 个（%5$@）已在本盘的其他备份中，不会再存一份。\n\n原文件不会被修改或删除。";
"Compare with" = "参照文件夹";
"Optional: folders already backed up (another drive, an older backup). Files found there are not backed up again. Other backups on the backup drive are always compared." = "可选：以前备份过的文件夹（其他硬盘、旧的备份）。其中已有的文件不会再备份。备份盘上的其他备份始终会参与比对。";
"Add…" = "添加…";
"Add" = "添加";
"Remove" = "移除";
"Choose folders that are already backed up. Files found in them are not backed up again." = "选择已经备份过的文件夹。其中已有的文件不会再备份。";
"Free on drive" = "备份盘剩余";
